<p>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_1142_3705.jpg" n="1"/>
<lb n="1"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Unser</unclear> früntlich willig diennst, sampt was wir
<lb n="2"/>Eeren liebs unnd guots <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">vermoegend</unclear> zuovor, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">From</unclear>,
<lb n="3"/>fürsichtig, Ersam, wyß, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Innsonders</unclear> guot <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">frünndt</unclear>
<lb n="4"/>unnd gethrüw lieb <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Eydtgnoßen</unclear>. Ir sind
<lb n="5"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zwyffels</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fryg</unclear>, nun <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">meer</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">wol</unclear> bericht, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">wie</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">uß</unclear> be=
<lb n="6"/>wegenden ursachen, von <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gemeiner</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zwoelff</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">orthen</unclear>
<lb n="7"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gsannten</unclear> uff üwer unnd <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">unnserer</unclear> lieben <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Eydtgnoß=</unclear>
<lb n="8"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">en</unclear> von <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-13" cert="medium" resp="#ner">Bern</placeName>, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">bezigner</unclear> sachen, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">warhafftige</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">getrane</unclear>
<lb n="9"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">enntschuldigung</unclear>, vier <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">gsannte</unclear>, zuo <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-437" cert="medium" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Fr</unclear>. <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Dt</unclear>. Inn <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Saphoyg</unclear></placeName>,
<lb n="10"/>umb <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">abfuerung</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Ires</unclear> an die <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">gränntzen</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">gelegtten</unclear>
<lb n="11"/>kriegsvolcks unnd <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zuosätzen</unclear>, früntlichen anzehallten
<lb n="12"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">erwellt</unclear>, unnd <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">abgefertiget</unclear> worden, da wir <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">geachtet</unclear>,
<lb n="13"/>alle sachen <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">werdent</unclear>, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">biß</unclear> uff derselben <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ußgesannten</unclear>
<lb n="14"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">widerheimbkunfft</unclear>, Inn <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ruowen</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">blyben</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">anstaan</unclear>,
<lb n="15"/>diewyl unns aber gloublich fürkompt, das by üwern
<lb n="16"/>unnd <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">unnseren</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Eydtgnoßen</unclear>, Inn den <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Fünnff</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">orthen</unclear>
<lb n="17"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">glych</unclear> künfftiger <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">wochen</unclear>, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">fünnff</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">fenndlj</unclear> mit volck
<lb n="18"/>dem hertzogen von <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-437" cert="medium" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Saphoyg</unclear></placeName> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zuozeziehen</unclear>, Inn aller <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">berreit=</unclear>
<lb n="19"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">schafft</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">sygen</unclear>. Unnd <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">werdint</unclear> den wäg über den <placeName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Gotthart</unclear></placeName>
<lb n="20"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">nëmen</unclear>, sy als zuo einem zuosatz <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Imes</unclear> hertzogen namen
<lb n="21"/>zebruchen. Habenn wir üch als unnser <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ver=</unclear>
<lb n="22"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">trüwt</unclear> lieb <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Eydtgnoßen</unclear>, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">eines</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">soellichen</unclear> dennocht ouch
<lb n="23"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">hiemit</unclear> berichten wellen. <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Zuodem</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">gaadt</unclear> ein Redt,
<lb n="24"/>das vil Spanngisch unnd <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Italienisch</unclear> kriegsvolck,
<lb n="25"/>sich gägen <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">einer</unclear> <orgName ref="stadtasg-actors-750" cert="medium" resp="#ner">Eydtgnoschafft</orgName> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">gesterck</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">nechere</unclear>,
<lb n="26"/>was <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vorhabens</unclear> sy nun <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">sygen</unclear>, Ist <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">allerleyg</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">bedennckens</unclear>
<lb n="27"/>darüber. Sonnderlichen <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ob</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">es</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">villichter</unclear> umb ein Statt
<lb n="28"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Jännff</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zethuond</unclear>. So nun der offenn krieg sich
<lb n="29"/>daselbs erheben, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">worde</unclear> einer <orgName ref="stadtasg-actors-750" cert="medium" resp="#ner">Eydtgnoschafft</orgName> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">unruowen</unclear>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_1142_3706.jpg" n="2"/>
<lb n="30"/>gung, darob <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zuerwarten</unclear> syn. <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Imfal</unclear> aber unns
<lb n="31"/>diser oder annderer <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">dinngen</unclear>, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">etwas</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">wythers</unclear> an-
<lb n="32"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">lanngte</unclear>, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">sol</unclear> üch das guotwillig <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">mitgetheillt</unclear> werden,
<lb n="33"/>üch <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">frünntlich</unclear> bittende, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">woverr</unclear> üch <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">etwas</unclear>
<lb n="34"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zukeme</unclear>, unns <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">deß</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">jederzyth</unclear> ouch inn <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">guoter</unclear>
<lb n="35"/>correspondentz wüssen <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zelaßen</unclear>, unnd sind
<lb n="36"/>üch zuo aller guotwilligen <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">frünndtschafft</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">thrüw</unclear>
<lb n="37"/>unnd liebe ganntz <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">bereith</unclear>, unnd gneigten anerbiet-
<lb n="38"/>ens, hiemit dem <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">schirm</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">goettlicher</unclear> gnaaden
<lb n="39"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">bevelchende</unclear>. Datum den <origDate when="1582-06-14" cert="medium" resp="#ner">14ten junij
<lb n="40"/>anno etc. 82</origDate>.
<lb n="41"/><orgName ref="stadtasg-actors-503" cert="medium" role="issuer" resp="#ner">Burgermeister und rath
<lb n="42"/>der statt Zürich</orgName>.
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_1142_3707.jpg" n="3"/>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_1142_3708.jpg" n="4"/>
<lb n="43"/>Den frommen fürsichtigen ersamen wysen
<lb n="44"/><orgName ref="stadtasg-actors-148" cert="medium" role="recipient" resp="#ner">Burgermeister unnd Rath der Statt
<lb n="45"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Sannct</unclear> Gallen</orgName>. unnseren <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">innsonnders</unclear>
<lb n="46"/>guoten <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">frünnden</unclear> unnd getrüwen
<lb n="47"/>lieben <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Eydtgnosßenn</unclear>.
</p>
